                    <li>Handle expected file-related exceptions.</li>
                    <li>Avoid unnecessary file operations.</li>
                    <li>Use streaming APIs for large files when appropriate.</li>
                    <li>Never trust user-provided file paths without validation.</li>
                </ul>


